  - Environment variable: N8N_OPENAI_FALLBACK_ENABLED=false
  - Credential setting: "Disable Responses API fallback"

  Workaround

  Until this is fixed, users can manually add apiStyle: 'chat' to the credential JSON in the database:

  UPDATE credential
  SET data = jsonb_set(data, '{apiStyle}', '"chat"')
  WHERE id = 'YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID';

  Impact

  - Affects all self-hosted n8n instances using custom OpenAI-compatible endpoints
  - Prevents agent functionality when Responses API is partially implemented or has validation bugs
  - No impact on official OpenAI API usage (which properly supports Responses API)

  Related Files

  - packages/@n8n/agents/src/runtime/model/openai-api-style.ts - Fallback logic
  - packages/@n8n/agents/src/runtime/model/model-factory.ts - Credential handling
  - packages/@n8n/agents/src/runtime/model/provider-credentials.ts - Credential schema

